#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:355
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Divide et impera (lat. \"Divide and conquer\") - by splitting a window into two "
"parts (e.g. Window -> <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"> "
"Split View Left/Right) you can make Konqueror appear the way you like. You can "
"even load some example view-profiles (e.g. Midnight Commander), or create your "
"own ones."
msgstr ""
"Pisah dan tawan - dengan memisahkan tetingkap kepada dua bahagian (cth. "
"Tetingkap <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\">&nbsp; Pisah Lihat Kiri/Kanan) "
"anda boleh memjadikan Konqueror dipaparkan sebagaimana yang anda suka. Anda "
"boleh juga memuatkan contoh papar-profail (cth. Midnight Commander), atau cipta "
"anda punya sendiri."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:360
#, fuzzy
